    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village’s name comes from the Marble Cliff Quarry Co., which supplied stone for early buildings.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marble_Cliff%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ten homes designed by famed Ohio architect Frank Packard line the village, one listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
