      ],
      "source": "https://tours.grandviewhistorywalks.org/about-marble-cliff-tour"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Bush mansion, home of Senator Samuel Prescott Bush, now serves as upscale condominiums called Prescott Place.",
